近有水灘時，會吸水並使擊破效率提升30%，持續15秒。",{"attributes":211,"type":212,"consume":213,"power":214},[21],[190],"30","19",{"id":216,"type":146,"props":217},"91268598_38",{"id":218,"customKey":45,"icon":219,"iconStyle":64,"iconTitle":45,"descTitle":220,"descContent":221,"source":222},"91268598_39","/cdn/init/1017400_Skill_10301530_Icon.png","擊水之盾","獲得6%最大生命的水盾，持續15秒。持續期間每次技能命中時，對目標再次追加一次技能傷害，每0.5秒觸發1次。",{"attributes":223,"type":224,"consume":225,"power":213},[21],[190],"20",{"id":227,"title":228,"children":229},"91268598_40","固有技能",[230,242],{"id":231,"type":146,"props":232},"91268598_41",{"id":233,"customKey":45,"icon":234,"iconStyle":64,"iconTitle":45,"descTitle":235,"descContent":236,"source":237},"91268598_42","/cdn/init/1017400_Skill_10300160_Icon.png","再見全壘打","揮舞鏟子使出全力的一擊，造成傷害。",{"attributes":238,"type":239,"consume":240,"power":241},[21],[190],"0","176",{"id":243,"type":146,"props":244},"91268598_43",{"id":245,"customKey":45,"icon":246,"iconStyle":64,"iconTitle":45,"descTitle":247,"descContent":248,"source":249},"91268598_44","/cdn/init/1017400_Skill_16200000_Icon.png","攻擊","擊破使用水元素能力，近距離攻擊目標。",{"attributes":250,"type":251,"consume":240,"power":252},[21],[190],"6",[254,255,256],{"id":4,"entryId":12,"currentMorphology":20,"visible":14},{"id":6,"entryId":12,"currentMorphology":9,"visible":14},{"id":257,"entryId":12,"currentMorphology":258,"visible":14},"10003583","Prismana Form",[260,272,283,293,304,314,324,336,346,356,366,377,387,398,408,419,430,440,450,460,470,480,490,501,511,521,531,541,551,561,571,581,591,601,611,621,631,642,652,662,672,682,692,702,712,722,732,742,752,761,770,778,782,792,802,812,822,832,842,852,862,872,882,892,902,912,922,932,942,952,962,972,982,992,1002,1012,1022,1032,1042,1052,1062,1072,1082,1092,1102,1112,1122,1132,1142,1152,1162,1172,1182,1193],{"id":261,"viewCount":58,"searchKey":262,"visible":14},"10003442",{"type":10,"entryId":263,"sortOrder":264,"name":265,"imageUrl":266,"description":267,"currentMorphology":20,"currentStage":190,"position":268,"attributes":270},"001",1005100,"小炭狗","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10051.png","活潑好動且總愛跟在焚火狼後頭。蓬鬆炭毛中夾雜著隱燃星火，當火光匯聚燃燒之時，便是牠成長之日。",[269],"position-dps",[271],"attributes-fire",{"id":273,"viewCount":58,"searchKey":274,"visible":14},"10003534",{"type":10,"entryId":275,"sortOrder":276,"name":277,"imageUrl":278,"description":279,"currentMorphology":20,"currentStage":280,"position":281,"attributes":282},"002",1005200,"焚火狼","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10052.png","習慣成群結隊活動，極度重視忠誠與團結，冷靜專注的眼神下隱藏著如烈焰般熾熱的心。","2",[269],[271],{"id":284,"viewCount":58,"searchKey":285,"visible":14},"10003435",{"type":10,"entryId":286,"sortOrder":287,"name":288,"imageUrl":289,"description":290,"currentMorphology":20,"currentStage":21,"position":291,"attributes":292},"003",1005300,"狼鬥士","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10053.png","性格好勝，面對越強大的對手越是熱血沸騰。烈火與焦炭將化為印記，見證牠不斷變強的歷程。",[269],[271],{"id":294,"viewCount":58,"searchKey":295,"visible":14},"10003428",{"type":10,"entryId":296,"sortOrder":297,"name":298,"imageUrl":299,"description":300,"currentMorphology":20,"currentStage":21,"position":301,"attributes":302},"004",1005500,"獄魂狼","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10055.png","挑戰強者落敗的焚火狼，吸收了同樣懷恨倒下的同伴靈魂，以復仇的欲望驅使自身行動。",[23],[271,303],"attributes-dark",{"id":305,"viewCount":58,"searchKey":306,"visible":14},"10003578",{"type":10,"entryId":307,"sortOrder":308,"name":309,"imageUrl":310,"description":311,"currentMorphology":20,"currentStage":190,"position":312,"attributes":313},"005",1001100,"星樂蒂","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10011.png","在林間飛行尋找食物時，頭上的發光星星常被誤認作流星。超級貪吃，有囤積食物的習慣，也會用食物來裝飾自己的小窩。",[269],[303],{"id":315,"viewCount":58,"searchKey":316,"visible":14},"10003417",{"type":10,"entryId":317,"sortOrder":318,"name":319,"imageUrl":320,"description":321,"currentMorphology":20,"currentStage":21,"position":322,"attributes":323},"006",1001200,"星法師","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10012.png","獨來獨往，常穿梭在夜色之中。外型如同身披星空斗篷的神祕魔法師，能夠使用精神能量進行瞬移。",[269],[303],{"id":325,"viewCount":58,"searchKey":326,"visible":14},"10003488",{"type":10,"entryId":327,"sortOrder":328,"name":329,"imageUrl":330,"description":331,"currentMorphology":20,"currentStage":190,"position":332,"attributes":334},"007",1018100,"口哨鷗","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10181.png","常盤旋於低空並時刻注意沙灘動靜。喜歡湊熱鬧並發出清脆口哨聲起哄。",[333],"position-sup",[335],"attributes-wind",{"id":337,"viewCount":58,"searchKey":338,"visible":14},"10003548",{"type":10,"entryId":339,"sortOrder":340,"name":341,"imageUrl":342,"description":343,"currentMorphology":20,"currentStage":21,"position":344,"attributes":345},"008",1018400,"長號鷗","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10184.png","生性熱鬧且能奏出充滿節奏感的樂聲，常按捺不住內心衝動，加入同伴間的即興合奏。",[333],[335],{"id":347,"viewCount":58,"searchKey":348,"visible":14},"10003474",{"type":10,"entryId":349,"sortOrder":350,"name":351,"imageUrl":352,"description":353,"currentMorphology":20,"currentStage":21,"position":354,"attributes":355},"009",1018500,"小號鷗","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10185.png","能發出響徹海灘的嘹亮尖叫，愛出風頭的牠並不在意製造噪音。為了耳朵健康，最好別惹怒牠。",[269],[335],{"id":357,"viewCount":58,"searchKey":358,"visible":14},"10003467",{"type":10,"entryId":359,"sortOrder":360,"name":361,"imageUrl":362,"description":363,"currentMorphology":20,"currentStage":21,"position":364,"attributes":365},"010",1018700,"大號鷗","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10187.png","能發出低沉的大號音色。性格如音色般厚重沉穩且待人友善，風暴降臨海岸時，待在牠身邊總能感到安心。",[23],[335],{"id":367,"viewCount":58,"searchKey":368,"visible":14},"10003392",{"type":10,"entryId":369,"sortOrder":370,"name":371,"imageUrl":372,"description":373,"currentMorphology":20,"currentStage":190,"position":374,"attributes":375},"011",1021100,"飄飄花","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10211.png","飄飄花的身軀極其輕盈，常乘風飄起並藉由花瓣裙的阻力緩緩旋轉降落，或是乾脆隨風四處旅行。",[269],[376],"attributes-grass",{"id":378,"viewCount":58,"searchKey":379,"visible":14},"10003510",{"type":10,"entryId":380,"sortOrder":381,"name":382,"imageUrl":383,"description":384,"currentMorphology":20,"currentStage":21,"position":385,"attributes":386},"012",1021200,"花舞蘭","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10212.png","沉浸於表演之中，最大目標是精進舞藝，期盼有朝一日讓所有生物都能感受舞蹈中的生命力。",[269],[376],{"id":388,"viewCount":58,"searchKey":389,"visible":14},"10003477",{"type":10,"entryId":390,"sortOrder":391,"name":392,"imageUrl":393,"description":394,"currentMorphology":20,"currentStage":190,"position":395,"attributes":397},"014",1004100,"蓮頂魚","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10041.png","喜歡躲在水下探頭觀察新鮮事物。牠以為蓮葉帽是絕佳偽裝，卻不知在水面移動的蓮葉更引人注目。",[396],"position-heal",[25],{"id":399,"viewCount":58,"searchKey":400,"visible":14},"10003569",{"type":10,"entryId":401,"sortOrder":402,"name":403,"imageUrl":404,"description":405,"currentMorphology":20,"currentStage":280,"position":406,"attributes":407},"015",1004200,"搗蛋魚","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10042.png","極度懼怕高溫，喜歡待在涼爽濕潤處。體表覆蓋著保濕降溫膜，觸感滑溜。若離開水太久，皮膚會乾裂。",[396],[25],{"id":409,"viewCount":58,"searchKey":410,"visible":14},"10003470",{"type":10,"entryId":411,"sortOrder":412,"name":413,"imageUrl":414,"description":415,"currentMorphology":20,"currentStage":21,"position":416,"attributes":417},"016",1004300,"熒冰龍","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10043.png","外型與氣質皆極致優雅。天性善良且樂於照顧弱小，但若想利用這份善意傷害牠，將會被瞬間凍成冰塊。",[396],[25,418],"attributes-ice",{"id":420,"viewCount":58,"searchKey":421,"visible":14},"10003463",{"type":10,"entryId":422,"sortOrder":423,"name":424,"imageUrl":425,"description":426,"currentMorphology":20,"currentStage":21,"position":427,"attributes":429},"017",1004500,"蓮冠龍","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10045.png","與蓮花為伴並棲身於蓮葉間，習慣以擬態蓮葉的尾部遮掩面容，展現出矜持且高雅的姿態。",[428],"position-energy",[376,25],{"id":431,"viewCount":58,"searchKey":432,"visible":14},"10003468",{"type":10,"entryId":433,"sortOrder":434,"name":435,"imageUrl":436,"description":437,"currentMorphology":20,"currentStage":190,"position":438,"attributes":439},"018",1026100,"雲朵羊","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10261.png","喜歡在晴朗草原上成群活動，輕飄飄的身軀能懸停於雲霧中，三三兩兩擠作一團。",[333],[335],{"id":441,"viewCount":58,"searchKey":442,"visible":14},"10003365",{"type":10,"entryId":443,"sortOrder":444,"name":445,"imageUrl":446,"description":447,"currentMorphology":20,"currentStage":21,"position":448,"attributes":449},"019",1026200,"蓬蓬羊","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10262.png","喜歡躲在雲團中睡覺，因風壓與靜電存在，蓬鬆羊毛極易吸附隨風飛過的小物。",[333],[335],{"id":451,"viewCount":58,"searchKey":452,"visible":14},"10003461",{"type":10,"entryId":453,"sortOrder":454,"name":455,"imageUrl":456,"description":457,"currentMorphology":20,"currentStage":21,"position":458,"attributes":459},"020",1026300,"眠眠羊","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10263.png","吸收夢境能量的毛髮呈現出迷離幻彩。當牠將這團毛髮當作枕頭呼呼大睡時，便能沉入甜美夢鄉。",[333],[303],{"id":461,"viewCount":58,"searchKey":462,"visible":14},"10003421",{"type":10,"entryId":463,"sortOrder":464,"name":465,"imageUrl":466,"description":467,"currentMorphology":20,"currentStage":190,"position":468,"attributes":469},"021",1020100,"跑調草","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10201.png","成群結隊生活在草原上，平時鑽入地底吸收養分。喜歡聚在一起唱歌，卻對自己的走音毫無自覺。",[23],[376],{"id":471,"viewCount":58,"searchKey":472,"visible":14},"10003414",{"type":10,"entryId":473,"sortOrder":474,"name":475,"imageUrl":476,"description":477,"currentMorphology":20,"currentStage":21,"position":478,"attributes":479},"022",1020300,"女巫草","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10203.png","討厭闖入領地的生物，會發出古怪音波擾亂對手心智、降低防禦力，甚至能讓對方陷入昏迷。",[428],[303,376],{"id":481,"viewCount":58,"searchKey":482,"visible":14},"10003404",{"type":10,"entryId":483,"sortOrder":484,"name":485,"imageUrl":486,"description":487,"currentMorphology":20,"currentStage":21,"position":488,"attributes":489},"023",1020700,"埋埋草","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10207.png","曾長時間埋入地底，重見天日時已變得巨大無比。需靠根系吸收土壤養分維持活力，極度厭惡離開土地。",[23],[376],{"id":491,"viewCount":58,"searchKey":492,"visible":14},"10003567",{"type":10,"entryId":493,"sortOrder":494,"name":495,"imageUrl":496,"description":497,"currentMorphology":20,"currentStage":190,"position":498,"attributes":499},"024",1016100,"花芽蟹","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10161.png","一生只會選擇一名伴侶，對愛情極其專一且總是成雙成對活動。頭頂的蟹心草代表著牠的幸福程度。",[23],[500,376],"attributes-rock",{"id":502,"viewCount":58,"searchKey":503,"visible":14},"10003462",{"type":10,"entryId":504,"sortOrder":505,"name":506,"imageUrl":507,"description":508,"currentMorphology":20,"currentStage":21,"position":509,"attributes":510},"025",1016200,"蔥蔥蟹","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10162.png","茂盛植株完全覆蓋背殼並透過吸收日光提供養分，在陽光充足時，不必額外進食就能生存。",[23],[500,376],{"id":512,"viewCount":58,"searchKey":513,"visible":14},"10003551",{"type":10,"entryId":514,"sortOrder":515,"name":516,"imageUrl":517,"description":518,"currentMorphology":20,"currentStage":21,"position":519,"attributes":520},"026",1016300,"晶殼蟹","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10163.png","幽居於洞穴中且因食物含豐富礦物質，背殼逐漸被晶體覆蓋。平時藏身地下，以華麗背殼吸引獵物靠近。",[23],[418],{"id":522,"viewCount":58,"searchKey":523,"visible":14},"10003409",{"type":10,"entryId":524,"sortOrder":525,"name":526,"imageUrl":527,"description":528,"currentMorphology":20,"currentStage":190,"position":529,"attributes":530},"027",1033100,"幽幽焰","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10331.png","外表雖如火焰，但那僅是能量流動的型態，不僅不發熱還會吸收周圍熱量。有時會以此偽裝成篝火戲弄他人。",[428],[271],{"id":532,"viewCount":58,"searchKey":533,"visible":14},"10003507",{"type":10,"entryId":534,"sortOrder":535,"name":536,"imageUrl":537,"description":538,"currentMorphology":20,"currentStage":21,"position":539,"attributes":540},"028",1033300,"幻焰靈","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10333.png","僅在深夜現身，身軀由氣態能量構成，因此能隨意分裂，甚至具備製造分身的能力。",[428],[271],{"id":542,"viewCount":58,"searchKey":543,"visible":14},"10003542",{"type":10,"entryId":544,"sortOrder":545,"name":546,"imageUrl":547,"description":548,"currentMorphology":20,"currentStage":190,"position":549,"attributes":550},"029",1023100,"螢粉蝶","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10231.png","膽小且警惕，察覺危險便會尋找藏身處，但抖落的螢光鱗粉卻總是暴露行蹤。",[396],[335],{"id":552,"viewCount":58,"searchKey":553,"visible":14},"10003440",{"type":10,"entryId":554,"sortOrder":555,"name":556,"imageUrl":557,"description":558,"currentMorphology":20,"currentStage":21,"position":559,"attributes":560},"030",1023200,"幻翼蝶","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10232.png","個性冷淡且獨來獨往，察覺危險迫近時會搧動翅膀吹出鱗粉製造幻覺迷惑對手，隨後慢悠悠地離開。",[396],[335],{"id":562,"viewCount":58,"searchKey":563,"visible":14},"10003563",{"type":10,"entryId":564,"sortOrder":565,"name":566,"imageUrl":567,"description":568,"currentMorphology":20,"currentStage":240,"position":569,"attributes":570},"031",1023300,"幻夢蝶","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10233.png","蝶翼閃爍著絢麗光輝，揮動翅膀時灑落的鱗粉能促進花卉生長，使所到之處皆生機盎然。",[428],[335,376],{"id":572,"viewCount":58,"searchKey":573,"visible":14},"10003368",{"type":10,"entryId":574,"sortOrder":575,"name":576,"imageUrl":577,"description":578,"currentMorphology":20,"currentStage":190,"position":579,"attributes":580},"032",1044100,"大耳蝠","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10441.png","大耳朵高高聳立且對聲音極其敏感，只要是牠追蹤的動靜，無論遠近都不會遺漏。",[333],[335],{"id":582,"viewCount":58,"searchKey":583,"visible":14},"10003363",{"type":10,"entryId":584,"sortOrder":585,"name":586,"imageUrl":587,"description":588,"currentMorphology":20,"currentStage":21,"position":589,"attributes":590},"033",1044300,"偵探蝠","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10443.png","好奇心旺盛，熱衷於搜尋痕跡與追蹤目標，尾部圓環能放大超音波，輕鬆識破隱身把戲。",[333],[335],{"id":592,"viewCount":58,"searchKey":593,"visible":14},"10003515",{"type":10,"entryId":594,"sortOrder":595,"name":596,"imageUrl":597,"description":598,"currentMorphology":20,"currentStage":190,"position":599,"attributes":600},"034",1032100,"小哭苞","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10321.png","膽小且怕痛，稍有動靜就掉眼淚，但被逼急時也會揮舞棘刺反抗。當真正勇敢時，頭頂花苞便會綻放。",[269],[376],{"id":602,"viewCount":58,"searchKey":603,"visible":14},"10003496",{"type":10,"entryId":604,"sortOrder":605,"name":606,"imageUrl":607,"description":608,"currentMorphology":20,"currentStage":21,"position":609,"attributes":610},"035",1032300,"刺劍玫","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10323.png","刺莖化成的長劍平時收納於手臂葉片中，唯有戰鬥時才會抽出。性格無畏且不懼挑戰，盡心盡力守護著族群。",[269],[376],{"id":612,"viewCount":58,"searchKey":613,"visible":14},"10003378",{"type":10,"entryId":614,"sortOrder":615,"name":616,"imageUrl":617,"description":618,"currentMorphology":20,"currentStage":21,"position":619,"attributes":620},"036",1032400,"魅樂薇","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10324.png","為平息紛爭，它會散落馨香花瓣，令接觸者心生幸福感，進而使戰意消散。",[333],[376],{"id":622,"viewCount":58,"searchKey":623,"visible":14},"10003456",{"type":10,"entryId":624,"sortOrder":625,"name":626,"imageUrl":627,"description":628,"currentMorphology":20,"currentStage":190,"position":629,"attributes":630},"037",1047100,"河童蛋","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10471.png","休息時縮入殼中，有時會被誤認為伊莫蛋。害怕戰鬥卻愛湊熱鬧，喜歡揮舞草球跳舞助威。",[23],[376],{"id":632,"viewCount":58,"searchKey":633,"visible":14},"10003374",{"type":10,"entryId":634,"sortOrder":635,"name":636,"imageUrl":637,"description":638,"currentMorphology":20,"currentStage":21,"position":639,"attributes":640},"038",1047400,"霹靂蜥","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10474.png","四肢靈活的牠見誰都想炫耀華麗踢技，喜歡將蛻下的皮像兜帽一樣帥氣地套在頭上。",[333],[641],"attributes-electric",{"id":643,"viewCount":58,"searchKey":644,"visible":14},"10003443",{"type":10,"entryId":645,"sortOrder":646,"name":647,"imageUrl":648,"description":649,"currentMorphology":20,"currentStage":21,"position":650,"attributes":651},"039",1047500,"咆尾蜥","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10475.png","高聳鬣毛盡顯狂放，野性咆哮張揚本色。尾部構造能收納聲波，撞擊對手時會施放音爆攻擊。",[23],[376],{"id":653,"viewCount":58,"searchKey":654,"visible":14},"10003503",{"type":10,"entryId":655,"sortOrder":656,"name":657,"imageUrl":658,"description":659,"currentMorphology":20,"currentStage":190,"position":660,"attributes":661},"040",1035100,"採蜜鳥","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10351.png","將採集的花蜜儲存於體內發酵，吐出後可作為香水原料，是調香師們不可或缺的合作夥伴。",[333],[303],{"id":663,"viewCount":58,"searchKey":664,"visible":14},"10003521",{"type":10,"entryId":665,"sortOrder":666,"name":667,"imageUrl":668,"description":669,"currentMorphology":20,"currentStage":21,"position":670,"attributes":671},"041",1035200,"香氛鳥","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10352.png","對氣味極其挑剔，會取食不同花蜜儲存於體內，調配專屬香水原料，全身羽毛皆浸透著獨特香氣。",[333],[303],{"id":673,"viewCount":58,"searchKey":674,"visible":14},"10003508",{"type":10,"entryId":675,"sortOrder":676,"name":677,"imageUrl":678,"description":679,"currentMorphology":20,"currentStage":190,"position":680,"attributes":681},"042",1003100,"幽爪鐮","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10031.png","戰勝同伴是進化的唯一途徑。為了應對隨時出現的對手，牠隨時都在尋找合適的石頭磨利爪子。",[269],[303],{"id":683,"viewCount":58,"searchKey":684,"visible":14},"10003369",{"type":10,"entryId":685,"sortOrder":686,"name":687,"imageUrl":688,"description":689,"currentMorphology":20,"currentStage":21,"position":690,"attributes":691},"043",1003200,"淬刃螂","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10032.png","磨礪利刃並靜待時機，在暗影中以匿蹤之姿戲弄對手，是名追求一擊必殺的冷酷刺客。",[269],[303],{"id":693,"viewCount":58,"searchKey":694,"visible":14},"10003501",{"type":10,"entryId":695,"sortOrder":696,"name":697,"imageUrl":698,"description":699,"currentMorphology":20,"currentStage":21,"position":700,"attributes":701},"044",1003300,"電刺螂","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10033.png","前肢折斷的幽爪鐮吸收雷電之力進化而來，重塑後的逆刃鋒利無比，閃爍著耀眼的電光。",[269],[641],{"id":703,"viewCount":58,"searchKey":704,"visible":14},"10003422",{"type":10,"entryId":705,"sortOrder":706,"name":707,"imageUrl":708,"description":709,"currentMorphology":20,"currentStage":190,"position":710,"attributes":711},"045",1013100,"冰骨狼","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10131.png","長著一對大耳朵的元氣狼仔，胸前的冰骨領結是牠最愛的玩具。最討厭行事沒有邊界的小炭狗。",[269],[418],{"id":713,"viewCount":58,"searchKey":714,"visible":14},"10003575",{"type":10,"entryId":715,"sortOrder":716,"name":717,"imageUrl":718,"description":719,"currentMorphology":20,"currentStage":280,"position":720,"attributes":721},"046",1013200,"冰刃狼","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10132.png","唯恐喪失鬥志而極度反感被撫摸，跟隨族群捕獵時總是咬著冰刀衝在最前線，渴望成為獨當一面的戰士。",[269],[418],{"id":723,"viewCount":58,"searchKey":724,"visible":14},"10003415",{"type":10,"entryId":725,"sortOrder":726,"name":727,"imageUrl":728,"description":729,"currentMorphology":20,"currentStage":21,"position":730,"attributes":731},"047",1013300,"霜鋒狼","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10133.png","對實力充滿絕對自信的高傲戰士，口中冰刃散發著凜冽寒氣，唯有面對強敵時才會感到興奮。",[269],[418],{"id":733,"viewCount":58,"searchKey":734,"visible":14},"10003524",{"type":10,"entryId":735,"sortOrder":736,"name":737,"imageUrl":738,"description":739,"currentMorphology":20,"currentStage":190,"position":740,"attributes":741},"048",1022100,"閃電貂","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10221.png","生活在樹林間，攻擊時尾巴會冒出金色電光與劈啪作響的電流聲。動作靈巧敏捷，極難捕捉。",[23],[641],{"id":743,"viewCount":58,"searchKey":744,"visible":14},"10003475",{"type":10,"entryId":745,"sortOrder":746,"name":747,"imageUrl":748,"description":749,"currentMorphology":20,"currentStage":21,"position":750,"attributes":751},"049",1022200,"雷光貂","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10222.png","透過特殊毛髮產生的靜電吸引空氣中的帶電粒子來蓄電。被水淋濕會影響蓄電能力，因此雨天很少出現。",[23],[641],{"id":753,"viewCount":58,"searchKey":754,"visible":14},"10003523",{"type":10,"entryId":755,"sortOrder":756,"name":74,"imageUrl":757,"description":758,"currentMorphology":20,"currentStage":190,"position":759,"attributes":760},"050",1017100,"/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10171.png","會四處挖掘尋找求愛禮物，卻因太容易害羞而常告白失敗。用小爪子搓揉臉頰是牠的標誌性動作。",[23],[25],{"id":762,"viewCount":58,"searchKey":763,"visible":14},"10003398",{"type":10,"entryId":764,"sortOrder":765,"name":82,"imageUrl":766,"description":767,"currentMorphology":20,"currentStage":280,"position":768,"attributes":769},"051",1017200,"/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10172.png","會精心挑選貝殼並製作與身形相配的新鏟子。據說遇到心動對象時，身邊會浮現粉紅色的泡泡。",[23],[25],{"id":771,"viewCount":58,"searchKey":772,"visible":14},"10003516",{"type":10,"entryId":8,"sortOrder":773,"name":96,"imageUrl":774,"description":775,"currentMorphology":20,"currentStage":21,"position":776,"attributes":777},1017300,"/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10173.png","生性自戀且每天花大量時間梳理毛髮。精心計算出水姿態並享受被追隨的感覺，發達肌肉卻因毛髮濃密而無法炫耀。",[333],[25],{"id":4,"viewCount":58,"searchKey":779,"visible":14},{"type":10,"entryId":12,"sortOrder":16,"name":17,"imageUrl":18,"description":19,"currentMorphology":20,"currentStage":21,"position":780,"attributes":781},[23],[25],{"id":783,"viewCount":58,"searchKey":784,"visible":14},"10003453",{"type":10,"entryId":785,"sortOrder":786,"name":787,"imageUrl":788,"description":789,"currentMorphology":20,"currentStage":190,"position":790,"attributes":791},"054",1019100,"貝殼星","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10191.png","用柔軟腕足吸附貝殼包裹自身，混跡在沙灘的普通貝殼堆中，平時緊閉甲殼，僅在夜晚打開沐浴月光。",[269],[25],{"id":793,"viewCount":58,"searchKey":794,"visible":14},"10003577",{"type":10,"entryId":795,"sortOrder":796,"name":797,"imageUrl":798,"description":799,"currentMorphology":20,"currentStage":280,"position":800,"attributes":801},"055",1019200,"智多星","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10192.png","嚮往著璀璨星空，常躺在背殼上搖晃身體，閉上雙眼沉浸於星辰編織的夢境之中。",[269],[25],{"id":803,"viewCount":58,"searchKey":804,"visible":14},"10003570",{"type":10,"entryId":805,"sortOrder":806,"name":807,"imageUrl":808,"description":809,"currentMorphology":20,"currentStage":21,"position":810,"attributes":811},"056",1019400,"星騎士","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10194.png","將曾包裹自身的貝殼化作劍與盾，當脆弱的貝殼星遇險時會挺身而出。喜歡沿海岸線逐浪而行。",[269],[25],{"id":813,"viewCount":58,"searchKey":814,"visible":14},"10003565",{"type":10,"entryId":815,"sortOrder":816,"name":817,"imageUrl":818,"description":819,"currentMorphology":20,"currentStage":190,"position":820,"attributes":821},"057",1045100,"滾滾郎","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10451.png","從出生起就與石球形影不離，透過不斷滾動讓球體越來越圓，但牠推著的石球似乎不像表面上那麼簡單。",[269],[500],{"id":823,"viewCount":58,"searchKey":824,"visible":14},"10003476",{"type":10,"entryId":825,"sortOrder":826,"name":827,"imageUrl":828,"description":829,"currentMorphology":20,"currentStage":21,"position":830,"attributes":831},"058",1045300,"機車郎","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10453.png","像以前一樣倒著前進，因完全掌控了滾球技巧，能做出各種高難度動作攻擊目標。",[269],[500],{"id":833,"viewCount":58,"searchKey":834,"visible":14},"10003466",{"type":10,"entryId":835,"sortOrder":836,"name":837,"imageUrl":838,"description":839,"currentMorphology":20,"currentStage":21,"position":840,"attributes":841},"059",1045400,"岩球郎","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10454.png","與滾滾郎朝夕相伴的石球因顛簸而覺醒，厭倦了身不由己的它吞噬蟲體後，終於能憑藉自身意志進行活動。",[333],[500],{"id":843,"viewCount":58,"searchKey":844,"visible":14},"10003379",{"type":10,"entryId":845,"sortOrder":846,"name":847,"imageUrl":848,"description":849,"currentMorphology":20,"currentStage":190,"position":850,"attributes":851},"060",1029100,"天使茸","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10291.png","總是掛著招牌笑容，熱情邀請其他伊莫一同玩耍。雖偶爾因頑皮或嘴饞惹出麻煩，但總能獲得原諒。",[269],[641],{"id":853,"viewCount":58,"searchKey":854,"visible":14},"10003376",{"type":10,"entryId":855,"sortOrder":856,"name":857,"imageUrl":858,"description":859,"currentMorphology":20,"currentStage":21,"position":860,"attributes":861},"061",1029300,"疾電茸","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10293.png","憑藉毛髮優異的導電性能，凝集雷光之力延伸出雙翼，以疾馳之姿驅散陰霾，讓心情也隨之轉晴。",[269],[641],{"id":863,"viewCount":58,"searchKey":864,"visible":14},"10003543",{"type":10,"entryId":865,"sortOrder":866,"name":867,"imageUrl":868,"description":869,"currentMorphology":20,"currentStage":190,"position":870,"attributes":871},"062",1002100,"大眼盔","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10021.png","堅硬的頭盔保護柔軟的身體，能從口中伸出勾爪掠食，富有彈性的身體能裝下自身十倍體積的食物。",[23],[303],{"id":873,"viewCount":58,"searchKey":874,"visible":14},"10003557",{"type":10,"entryId":875,"sortOrder":876,"name":877,"imageUrl":878,"description":879,"currentMorphology":20,"currentStage":21,"position":880,"attributes":881},"063",1002600,"盔勇士","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10026.png","獲得斷劍與盔甲並傳承了勇氣與力量，終於成為一名能守護同伴、直面強敵的勇士。",[269],[303],{"id":883,"viewCount":58,"searchKey":884,"visible":14},"10003522",{"type":10,"entryId":885,"sortOrder":886,"name":887,"imageUrl":888,"description":889,"currentMorphology":20,"currentStage":21,"position":890,"attributes":891},"064",1002700,"盔衛士","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10027.png","身材高大卻性格膽小，遇到危險就縮成球逃避戰鬥，但為了守護同伴，牠也能鼓起勇氣應戰。",[23],[303],{"id":893,"viewCount":58,"searchKey":894,"visible":14},"10003579",{"type":10,"entryId":895,"sortOrder":896,"name":897,"imageUrl":898,"description":899,"currentMorphology":20,"currentStage":190,"position":900,"attributes":901},"065",1002400,"鋼顎仔","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10024.png","路過什麼都想啃一口。下巴活動性極佳，張開角度驚人。牠習慣以輕咬表達喜悅，尤其偏愛金屬製品，因為不容易咬壞。",[23],[335],{"id":903,"viewCount":58,"searchKey":904,"visible":14},"10003389",{"type":10,"entryId":905,"sortOrder":906,"name":907,"imageUrl":908,"description":909,"currentMorphology":20,"currentStage":280,"position":910,"attributes":911},"066",1002200,"盔面龍","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10022.png","幼龍將脆弱隱藏於頭盔之下，內心渴望變得更強並自由翱翔，前往世界各個角落尋找隱匿的寶藏。",[23],[335],{"id":913,"viewCount":58,"searchKey":914,"visible":14},"10003536",{"type":10,"entryId":915,"sortOrder":916,"name":917,"imageUrl":918,"description":919,"currentMorphology":20,"currentStage":21,"position":920,"attributes":921},"067",1002300,"銀盔龍","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10023.png","全身覆蓋著堅硬鎧甲，停駐於石台時宛如高大的雕像。傳說牠會守在遺跡入口，看守古老的寶藏。",[23],[335],{"id":923,"viewCount":58,"searchKey":924,"visible":14},"10003529",{"type":10,"entryId":925,"sortOrder":926,"name":927,"imageUrl":928,"description":929,"currentMorphology":20,"currentStage":21,"position":930,"attributes":931},"068",1002500,"炎鎧龍","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10025.png","身披烈焰淬煉後的金屬重鎧，暴怒噴發的火焰能瞬間將周遭化為熔岩。不想化為灰燼就離牠遠點。",[269],[271],{"id":933,"viewCount":58,"searchKey":934,"visible":14},"10003433",{"type":10,"entryId":935,"sortOrder":936,"name":937,"imageUrl":938,"description":939,"currentMorphology":20,"currentStage":190,"position":940,"attributes":941},"069",1050100,"迷夢仔","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10501.png","白天處於夢遊狀態，若被吵醒會瞬間暴躁失控，一旦體力耗盡便會乖乖墜入夢鄉。",[269],[500],{"id":943,"viewCount":58,"searchKey":944,"visible":14},"10003427",{"type":10,"entryId":945,"sortOrder":946,"name":947,"imageUrl":948,"description":949,"currentMorphology":20,"currentStage":21,"position":950,"attributes":951},"070",1050300,"暴睡熊","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10503.png","在平日的溫柔之下，是時刻的隱忍與克制，但若受刺激或腹中空空時，便會無法自控並陷入狂暴之中。",[269],[500],{"id":953,"viewCount":58,"searchKey":954,"visible":14},"10003405",{"type":10,"entryId":955,"sortOrder":956,"name":957,"imageUrl":958,"description":959,"currentMorphology":20,"currentStage":190,"position":960,"attributes":961},"071",1028100,"碎岩仔","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10281.png","天生具備感應礦石的能力，偏好進食各種礦石，且攝取的礦石種類會直接影響其成長方向。",[23],[500],{"id":963,"viewCount":58,"searchKey":964,"visible":14},"10003525",{"type":10,"entryId":965,"sortOrder":966,"name":967,"imageUrl":968,"description":969,"currentMorphology":20,"currentStage":280,"position":970,"attributes":971},"072",1028200,"熾岩龍","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10282.png","以堅硬利爪擊碎晶石後吞服以儲存熱量，體表也因此顯現火紅紋路。體型雖小巧，卻能從口中持續噴出高熱焰流。",[23],[271,500],{"id":973,"viewCount":58,"searchKey":974,"visible":14},"10003399",{"type":10,"entryId":975,"sortOrder":976,"name":977,"imageUrl":978,"description":979,"currentMorphology":20,"currentStage":21,"position":980,"attributes":981},"073",1028300,"熔暴龍","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10283.png","熾熱晶體如凝結的熔岩般於身軀生長，其積存的熱量若瞬間爆發，足以熔毀擋在面前的一切阻礙。",[23],[271,500],{"id":983,"viewCount":58,"searchKey":984,"visible":14},"10003518",{"type":10,"entryId":985,"sortOrder":986,"name":987,"imageUrl":988,"description":989,"currentMorphology":20,"currentStage":280,"position":990,"attributes":991},"074",1028400,"晶背龍","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10284.png","攝取的晶礦在體內經過提煉，會化為蘊含精純能量的晶脊向外生長。",[23],[500],{"id":993,"viewCount":58,"searchKey":994,"visible":14},"10003393",{"type":10,"entryId":995,"sortOrder":996,"name":997,"imageUrl":998,"description":999,"currentMorphology":20,"currentStage":21,"position":1000,"attributes":1001},"075",1028500,"晶簇龍","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10285.png","棲息於晶礦充足之地，背部晶脊極其堅硬，不僅能保護身體，更是儲存能量的重要結構。",[23],[500],{"id":1003,"viewCount":58,"searchKey":1004,"visible":14},"10003386",{"type":10,"entryId":1005,"sortOrder":1006,"name":1007,"imageUrl":1008,"description":1009,"currentMorphology":20,"currentStage":190,"position":1010,"attributes":1011},"076",1043100,"蟻煙囪","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10431.png","蟻煙囪用泥土一點一滴修築自己的外殼，遇險時會從頂部孔洞噴出煙霧籠罩四周，藉此遮掩身形。",[333],[500],{"id":1013,"viewCount":58,"searchKey":1014,"visible":14},"10003447",{"type":10,"entryId":1015,"sortOrder":1016,"name":1017,"imageUrl":1018,"description":1019,"currentMorphology":20,"currentStage":21,"position":1020,"attributes":1021},"077",1043300,"蟻地堡","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10433.png","上下身體具備可獨立旋轉的結構，讓蟻地堡能靈活觀察四周，並伺機變形出砲台擊退對手。",[333],[500],{"id":1023,"viewCount":58,"searchKey":1024,"visible":14},"10003497",{"type":10,"entryId":1025,"sortOrder":1026,"name":1027,"imageUrl":1028,"description":1029,"currentMorphology":20,"currentStage":190,"position":1030,"attributes":1031},"078",1014100,"燈泡水母","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10141.png","生性膽小，一有風吹草動便立刻逃走，頭頂燈泡狀器官會隨著健康狀況產生變化。",[333],[641],{"id":1033,"viewCount":58,"searchKey":1034,"visible":14},"10003479",{"type":10,"entryId":1035,"sortOrder":1036,"name":1037,"imageUrl":1038,"description":1039,"currentMorphology":20,"currentStage":280,"position":1040,"attributes":1041},"079",1014200,"燈紗水母","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10142.png","極度怕黑的水母，每當夜晚降臨便會開始發光，即便入睡也不熄滅，猶如一盞守夜明燈。",[333],[641],{"id":1043,"viewCount":58,"searchKey":1044,"visible":14},"10003388",{"type":10,"entryId":1045,"sortOrder":1046,"name":1047,"imageUrl":1048,"description":1049,"currentMorphology":20,"currentStage":21,"position":1050,"attributes":1051},"080",1014300,"吊燈水母","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10143.png","能根據心情自如調節發光的亮度與頻率。觸手不僅能閃爍出炫麗獨特的光斑，還能傳導電流攻擊目標。",[333],[641],{"id":1053,"viewCount":58,"searchKey":1054,"visible":14},"10003429",{"type":10,"entryId":1055,"sortOrder":1056,"name":1057,"imageUrl":1058,"description":1059,"currentMorphology":20,"currentStage":190,"position":1060,"attributes":1061},"081",1048100,"浴球鳥","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10481.png","揉搓體表油脂會產生大量泡沫，既能清潔又能保護自己，但有時也會踩到泡沫而滑倒。",[428],[25],{"id":1063,"viewCount":58,"searchKey":1064,"visible":14},"10003430",{"type":10,"entryId":1065,"sortOrder":1066,"name":1067,"imageUrl":1068,"description":1069,"currentMorphology":20,"currentStage":21,"position":1070,"attributes":1071},"082",1048300,"沐羽鳥","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10483.png","羽毛會不斷分泌油脂，稍加揉搓就能產生各式各樣的泡泡，而用於保護背上幼鳥的，自然是其中最柔軟綿密的一種。",[428],[25],{"id":1073,"viewCount":58,"searchKey":1074,"visible":14},"10003549",{"type":10,"entryId":1075,"sortOrder":1076,"name":1077,"imageUrl":1078,"description":1079,"currentMorphology":20,"currentStage":240,"position":1080,"attributes":1081},"083",1012200,"貝瑟斯","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10122.png","深受心跳鼓點困擾的貝瑟斯，不斷尋找能掩蓋鼓聲的節奏，熱愛搖擺身體並追求前衛的音樂藝術。",[428],[641],{"id":1083,"viewCount":58,"searchKey":1084,"visible":14},"10003494",{"type":10,"entryId":1085,"sortOrder":1086,"name":1087,"imageUrl":1088,"description":1089,"currentMorphology":20,"currentStage":190,"position":1090,"attributes":1091},"084",1038100,"珊殼魚","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10381.png","將身體埋入地底偽裝成珊瑚，一旦獵物靠近便會一口咬上。不過偶爾也會耐不住性子，露出眼睛四處張望。",[428],[500,25],{"id":1093,"viewCount":58,"searchKey":1094,"visible":14},"10003486",{"type":10,"entryId":1095,"sortOrder":1096,"name":1097,"imageUrl":1098,"description":1099,"currentMorphology":20,"currentStage":21,"position":1100,"attributes":1101},"085",1038300,"珊瑚龍","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10383.png","喜歡將身體埋在沙子中擬態成珊瑚叢，利用頭背部珊瑚的夜光誘捕生物並伺機突襲。",[428],[500,25],{"id":1103,"viewCount":58,"searchKey":1104,"visible":14},"10003530",{"type":10,"entryId":1105,"sortOrder":1106,"name":1107,"imageUrl":1108,"description":1109,"currentMorphology":20,"currentStage":190,"position":1110,"attributes":1111},"086",1046100,"海墩墩","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10461.png","腮幫子上的圓圈常被誤認為眼睛。喜歡成群結隊出現在海岸邊，與同伴擠在一起便會感到安心。",[23],[418],{"id":1113,"viewCount":58,"searchKey":1114,"visible":14},"10003457",{"type":10,"entryId":1115,"sortOrder":1116,"name":1117,"imageUrl":1118,"description":1119,"currentMorphology":20,"currentStage":21,"position":1120,"attributes":1121},"087",1046300,"浪海象","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10463.png","用四肢在陸地移動時略顯笨拙，但極其擅長以肚皮滑行。同性間領地意識極強，一旦動怒便會展現海嘯般的威壓。",[23],[418],{"id":1123,"viewCount":58,"searchKey":1124,"visible":14},"10003423",{"type":10,"entryId":1125,"sortOrder":1126,"name":1127,"imageUrl":1128,"description":1129,"currentMorphology":20,"currentStage":190,"position":1130,"attributes":1131},"088",1058100,"覓葉羊","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10581.png","懶洋洋地伸展葉羽，嘴裡總嚼個沒完，把綠藻和黏液變成飄飛的泡泡，輕輕一蹬，就能乘著泡泡悠悠出發。",[396],[376,25],{"id":1133,"viewCount":58,"searchKey":1134,"visible":14},"10003419",{"type":10,"entryId":1135,"sortOrder":1136,"name":1137,"imageUrl":1138,"description":1139,"currentMorphology":20,"currentStage":21,"position":1140,"attributes":1141},"089",1058300,"麗芙羊","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10583.png","披著翠綠葉羽的麗芙羊體態輕盈，在湖岸邊悠哉漫步，特別喜歡清澈的水面，老是沉迷於水中倒影那優雅從容的模樣。",[396],[376,25],{"id":1143,"viewCount":58,"searchKey":1144,"visible":14},"10003410",{"type":10,"entryId":1145,"sortOrder":1146,"name":1147,"imageUrl":1148,"description":1149,"currentMorphology":20,"currentStage":190,"position":1150,"attributes":1151},"090",1062100,"吐泡章魚","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10621.png","喜歡蒐集各種顏色的泡泡，氣囊裡的泡泡隨著身體動作起伏晃動，靈感一來，就會用繽紛的泡泡畫出奇妙的塗鴉。",[269],[25],{"id":1153,"viewCount":58,"searchKey":1154,"visible":14},"10003509",{"type":10,"entryId":1155,"sortOrder":1156,"name":1157,"imageUrl":1158,"description":1159,"currentMorphology":20,"currentStage":21,"position":1160,"attributes":1161},"091",1062300,"扭蛋章魚","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10623.png","靈活的觸手可以刺激腦袋噴出不同的扭蛋泡泡，誰也不知道泡泡裡藏的是驚喜還是驚嚇。",[269],[25],{"id":1163,"viewCount":58,"searchKey":1164,"visible":14},"10003413",{"type":10,"entryId":1165,"sortOrder":1166,"name":1167,"imageUrl":1168,"description":1169,"currentMorphology":20,"currentStage":190,"position":1170,"attributes":1171},"092",1042100,"海神魔","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10421.png","以開朗笑容偽裝自己並悄悄接近目標，一旦進入戰鬥便會顯露真面目，露出蓄勢待發的尖牙。",[269],[418],{"id":1173,"viewCount":58,"searchKey":1174,"visible":14},"10003407",{"type":10,"entryId":1175,"sortOrder":1176,"name":1177,"imageUrl":1178,"description":1179,"currentMorphology":20,"currentStage":21,"position":1180,"attributes":1181},"093",1042300,"魔海蝶","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10423.png","柔軟身軀中藏著尖牙與利爪，最擅長以溫柔無害的模樣令其他生物掉以輕心，再隨手將其凍成冰雕。",[269],[418],{"id":1183,"viewCount":58,"searchKey":1184,"visible":14},"10003498",{"type":10,"entryId":1185,"sortOrder":1186,"name":1187,"imageUrl":1188,"description":1189,"currentMorphology":20,"currentStage":240,"position":1190,"attributes":1191},"9997",1037300,"朧月狐","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10373.png","毛髮上流動著柔和月光，外表看似有些難以親近。總是理性冷靜地看待問題，但在面對熟悉之人時，也會露出親暱的神情。",[269],[1192],"attributes-holy",{"id":1194,"viewCount":58,"searchKey":1195,"visible":14},"10003375",{"type":10,"entryId":1196,"sortOrder":1197,"name":1198,"imageUrl":1199,"description":1200,"currentMorphology":20,"currentStage":240,"position":1201,"attributes":1202},"9998",1036100,"日耀獅","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10361.png","熱情活潑且自信滿滿，勇於保護同伴。關鍵時刻能覺醒強大力量，爆發出驚人的戰力。",[269],[1192],[1204,1212,1217,1222,1227,1232,1237,1242,1246,1249,1253,1258,1263,1268,1273,1278,1283,1288,1291],{"id":1205,"parentId":1206,"tagType":1207,"tagKey":1208,"name":1209,"language":1210,"sort":1211},"026e4b93d02640d817320316c3e0ae25","1500","morphologyTypes","Mountain Woods Form","山林型態","zh